51636], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09990172135202509, "compression_ratio": 1.79, "no_speech_prob": 0.22796069085597992}, {"id": 49, "seek": 20236, "start": 202.36, "end": 208.62, "text": " Is not life more than food, and the body more than clothing? Look at the birds of the air.", "tokens": [50365, 1119, 406, 993, 544, 813, 1755, 11, 293, 264, 1772, 544, 813, 11502, 30, 2053, 412, 264, 9009, 295, 264, 1988, 13, 50678], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10327212015787761, "compression_ratio": 1.7037037037037037, "no_speech_prob": 0.00016733913798816502}, {"id": 50, "seek": 20236, "start": 209.04000000000002, "end": 214.86, "text": " They neither sow nor reap, nor gather into barns, and yet your heavenly Father feeds them.", "tokens": [50699, 814, 9662, 19766, 6051, 39178, 11, 6051, 5448, 666, 18492, 82, 11, 293, 1939, 428, 29406, 7085, 23712, 552, 13, 50990], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10327212015787761, "compression_ratio": 1.7037037037037037, "no_speech_prob": 0.00016733913798816502}, {"id": 51, "seek": 20236, "start": 215.54000000000002, "end": 220.24, "text": " Are you not of more value than they? And which of you, by being anxious,", "tokens": [51024, 2014, 291, 406, 295, 544, 2158, 813, 436, 30, 400, 597, 295, 291, 11, 538, 885, 15166, 11, 51259], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10327212015787761, "compression_ratio": 1.7037037037037037, "no_speech_prob": 0.00016733913798816502}, {"id": 52, "seek": 20236, "start": 220.42000000000002, "end": 226.78000000000003, "text": " can add a single hour to his span of life? And why are you anxious about clothing?", "tokens": [51268, 393, 909, 257, 2167, 1773, 281, 702, 16174, 295, 993, 30, 400, 983, 366, 291, 15166, 466, 11502, 30, 51586], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10327212015787761, "compression_ratio": 1.7037037037037037, "no_speech_prob": 0.00016733913798816502}, {"id": 53, "seek": 20236, "start": 227.4, "end": 232.34, "text": " Consider the lilies of the field, how they grow. They neither toil nor spin.", "tokens": [51617, 17416, 264, 375, 24119, 295, 264, 2519, 11, 577, 436, 1852, 13, 814, 9662, 9499, 6051, 6060, 13, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10327212015787761, "compression_ratio": 1.7037037037037037, "no_speech_prob": 0.00016733913798816502}, {"id": 54, "seek": 23236, "start": 233.08, "end": 238.02, "text": " Yet I tell you, even Solomon in all his glory was not arrayed like one of these.", "tokens": [50401, 10890, 286, 980, 291, 11, 754, 32209, 294, 439, 702, 11924, 390, 406, 10225, 292, 411, 472, 295, 613, 13, 50648], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1074416746786975, "compression_ratio": 1.6352941176470588, "no_speech_prob": 2.6688467187341303e-05}, {"id": 55, "seek": 23236, "start": 238.58, "end": 244.0, "text": " But if God so clothes the grass of the field, which today is alive and tomorrow is thrown", "tokens": [50676, 583, 498, 1265, 370, 5534, 264, 8054, 295, 264, 2519, 11, 597, 965, 307, 5465, 293, 4153, 307, 11732, 50947], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1074416746786975, "compression_ratio": 1.6352941176470588, "no_speech_prob": 2.6688467187341303e-05}, {"id": 56, "seek": 23236, "start": 244.0, "end": 252.24, "text": " into the oven, will he not much more clothe you? O you of little faith! Therefore do not be anxious,", "tokens": [50947, 666, 264, 9090, 11, 486, 415, 406, 709, 544, 596, 24863, 291, 30, 422, 291, 295, 707, 4522, 0, 7504, 360, 406, 312, 15166, 11, 51359], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1074416746786975, "compression_ratio": 1.6352941176470588, "no_speech_prob": 2.6688467187341303e-05}, {"id": 57, "seek": 23236, "start": 252.24, "end": 257.04, "text": " saying, What shall we eat, or what shall we drink, or what shall we wear?", "tokens": [51359, 1566, 11, 708, 4393, 321, 1862, 11, 420, 437, 4393, 321, 2822, 11, 420, 437, 4393, 321, 3728, 30, 51599], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1074416746786975, "compression_ratio": 1.6352941176470588, "no_speech_prob": 2.6688467187341303e-05}, {"id": 58, "seek": 23236, "start": 257.76, "end": 262.28000000000003, "text": " For the Gentiles seek after all these things, and your heavenly Father,", "tokens": [51635, 1171, 264, 33070, 4680, 8075, 934, 439, 613, 721, 11, 293, 428, 29406, 7085, 11, 51861], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1074416746786975, "compression_ratio": 1.6352941176470588, "no_speech_prob": 2.6688467187341303e-05}, {"id": 59, "seek": 26236, "start": 262.36, "end": 267.58000000000004, "text": " knows that you need them all. But seek first the kingdom of God and his righteousness,", "tokens": [50365, 3255, 300, 291, 643, 552, 439, 13, 583, 8075, 700, 264, 10231, 295, 1265, 293, 702, 26407, 11, 50626], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11773184479260054, "compression_ratio": 1.5389221556886228, "no_speech_prob": 0.000574772129766643}, {"id": 60, "seek": 26236, "start": 268.14, "end": 273.3, "text": " and all these things will be added to you. Therefore do not be anxious about tomorrow,", "tokens": [50654, 293, 439, 613, 721, 486, 312, 3869, 281, 291, 13, 7504, 360, 406, 312, 15166, 466, 4153, 11, 50912], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11773184479260054, "compression_ratio": 1.5389221556886228, "no_speech_prob": 0.000574772129766643}, {"id": 61, "seek": 26236, "start": 273.78000000000003, "end": 279.3, "text": " for tomorrow will be anxious for itself. Sufficient for the day is its own trouble.", "tokens": [50936, 337, 4153, 486, 312, 15166, 337, 2564, 13, 318, 30664, 337, 264, 786, 307, 1080, 1065, 5253, 13, 51212], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11773184479260054, "compression_ratio": 1.5389221556886228, "no_speech_prob": 0.000574772129766643}], "language": "English"}